This licence covers the code in this repository (process/, docs/js/, docs/css/,
docs/index.html, tools/). It does NOT cover:

  * the DEEP place-name data, whether the mirrored XML (data/, not committed)
    or the derived files in docs/data/. Those are: "Digitisation of English
    Placenames MADS data is licensed to Jisc by the English Place Names
    Society and released under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial
    4.0 International License." (http://mads.digitalresources.jisc.ac.uk/mads2017/)

  * docs/symphonym/: the Symphonym v8 model and vocabularies (Stephen Gadd,
    CC BY 4.0, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22767194) and the tokeniser port
    from the World Historical Gazetteer (BSD 3-Clause, University of Pittsburgh;
    see docs/symphonym/LICENSE-whg3).
